      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/hollywood/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Tennessee Valley Authority began building the Bellefonte Nuclear Generating Station in 1974, but the plant was never completed and is now abandoned.",
